{
  "schema_version": "0.1",
  "detector": "amsre_doc_ufcn_fusion",
  "description": "Fusion Gen3 uses the calibrated AMSRE winner as primary geometry and calibrated Doc-UFCN as a selective rescue. The second-stage refinement adds AMSRE refined-ray support as the discriminating gate: prior evidence shows the false rescues on Golden Set pages 1/5 retained ~80% refined support while the legitimate rescues on pages 9/10 retained 0%/~56%. The established exhaustive grid preserves the previously characterized score/confidence scope; the adaptive grid independently varies those gates and searches finer support/corner domains so influence and interactions can be identified without changing the exhaustive oracle.",
